                ^"Category" STRING "Outfittings" FIXED
                ^"Modifiers" STRING "–1 Upkeep."
                ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
            }
            DESCRIPTION "Due to a lack of certain ingredients, lab work involving either one specific Technique or two specific Forms is severely hampered — relevant Lab Totals are halved. For example, the lab might contain no silver, in which case Terram and Vim Lab Totals are halved. It does not take a season to remove this Flaw, if sufficient funds are available to increase the Upkeep."
        }
        #tHsNvcekc3PvBAQ4OK4FAs28 ^"Missing Sanctum Marker (Lab Flaw)" DEF {
